# pubsub1 — PUBLISH
#
# Learn: PUBLISH channel message sends a message to every client that is
# subscribed right now, and replies with how many received it. Nothing is
# stored: with no subscriber, the message is simply gone (streams, later
# in this chapter, are the durable alternative).
#
# Task: announce that order 42 shipped by publishing the message
# "shipped 42" on the channel orders:eu. The check has a subscriber
# listening. The line below doesn't do what it looks like.
#

PUBLISH orders:eu shipped 42
